{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 44","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If an integer of two digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> times the sum of its digits, the number formed by interchanging the digits is the sum of the digits multiplied by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d26f13dff1a8516ea9f7e35b9569533f3e76df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) \\ } 9-k  \\qquad \\textbf{(B) \\ } 10-k \\qquad \\textbf{(C) \\ } 11-k \\qquad \\textbf{(D) \\ } k-1 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) \\ } k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"563\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92d59bb9b788c58e9e56785b46aa3fae48e0d77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 10a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" />. The problem states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ff78ba8f895676e42e70bd2877328a225c5d508.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a+b=k(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />. We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/7/9176dbb10bbd5b87556c82c6b0a41a4319097f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10b+a=x(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />. Adding these two equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0acc738b017fc078f4d29c0003555ccce19f64c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11(a+b) = (k+x)(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"205\" height=\"18\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/d/5fd2f868a898bbce4b8c9cc87f06168d0bd88fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/7/6e714e29ed7123550575b9b51c383f5e4cb1e8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 = k + x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/6/cf694512f42e0f7fc87d19d854e5feae899b4daa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) \\ } 11-k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">Problem 43</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">Problem 45</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=19